    's10.h': '10 · Accessibility statement (VPAT-lite)',
    's10.p1': 'The Critical Thinking Breakouts aims to meet <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/">WCAG 2.1 Level AA</a> for this kind of interactive content. This summary is for procurement reviewers who want a VPAT-style overview without the full form.',
